{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "שופטים", :translit "shof'tim", :gloss "Judges"} {:he "רגלים", :translit "r'galim", :gloss "Festivals"} {:he "אזהרה לב\"ד שיעשוך", :translit "azharah l'beit din sheya'asukha", :gloss "a warning from the court that they must do so"} {:he "סקבא דשתא ריגלא", :translit "sikba d'shata rigla", :gloss "the eve of the year is a festival"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "smikhut: שופטים placed after רגלים at end of prior parashah to link them"}], :frame {:text "The Mishnah in Rosh Hashanah 2a–2b discusses that the calendar and its festivals are set by the court. The Talmud in Rosh Hashanah 5a–5b discusses bringing vows and obligations to the festival. The phrase 'סקבא דשתא ריגלא' appears in the Talmudic context of festival-eve procedures.", :sources ["Rosh Hashanah 2a" "Rosh Hashanah 5a" "Rosh Hashanah 5b"]}} {:quotes [{:he "כברכת ה' אלהיך אשר נתן לך", :translit "k'virkat Hashem Elokekha asher natan lakh", :gloss "like the blessing of the Lord your God which He gave you"} {:he "אשר נתן לך", :translit "asher natan lakh", :gloss "which He gave you"} {:he "שופטים", :translit "shof'tim", :gloss "Judges"} {:he "לתת מנת וגו'", :translit "latet manat v'gomer", :gloss "to give a portion etc."} {:he "למען יחזקו בתורת ה'", :translit "l'ma'an yakhz'ku b'torat Hashem", :gloss "so that they strengthen themselves in the Torah of the Lord"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "remez: re-reading 'asher natan lakh' as 'give to the judges' via rearrangement"}], :frame nil} {:quotes [{:he "איש כמתנת ידו", :translit "ish k'm'tnat yado", :gloss "each according to the gift of his hand"} {:he "שופטים", :translit "shof'tim", :gloss "Judges"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "remez linking the word שופטים to the concept of collecting charity"}], :frame {:text "The Talmud in Bava Batra 8a–8b discusses the court's authority to pledge collateral to compel charity contributions.", :sources ["Bava Batra 8a" "Bava Batra 8b"]}} {:quotes [{:he "ש